@startuml
skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam roundcorner 8
skinparam maxMessageSize 90

skinparam defaultFontName Arial
skinparam defaultFontSize 13

skinparam sequence {
  ArrowColor #374151
  ArrowThickness 1
  LifeLineBorderColor #CBD5E1
  LifeLineBackgroundColor #FFFFFF

  ParticipantBorderColor #475569
  ParticipantBackgroundColor #F8FAFC
  ParticipantFontColor #111827

  ActorBorderColor #475569
  ActorBackgroundColor #F8FAFC
  ActorFontColor #111827

  BoxBorderColor #CBD5E1
  BoxFontColor #111827
  BoxFontStyle bold

  GroupBorderColor #CBD5E1
  GroupBackgroundColor #F9FAFB
  GroupFontColor #111827
}

skinparam note {
  BackgroundColor #F9FAFB
  BorderColor #CBD5E1
  FontColor #111827
}

title Executor Runtime Service - Current Local Tool Flow
autonumber

box "Executor Runtime Service" #EFF6FF
participant "Dispatch Step\nUse Case" as DispatchStepUseCase
participant "Capability\nResolver" as CapabilityResolver
end box

box "External Systems" #F8FAFC
participant "Tool Registry" as ToolRegistry
end box

box "Execution Targets" #F8FAFC
participant "Local Tool\nExecutor" as LocalToolExecutor
participant "Workflow Control\nPlane" as WorkflowControlPlane
end box

box "Downstream" #F8FAFC
participant "Dispatch Step\nResult" as DispatchStepResult
end box

group Dispatch local tool
note over DispatchStepUseCase #FEF3C7
WARNING:
Entry point for this diagram:
a validated tool.<uuid> step has already reached DispatchStepUseCase.
Validation and status publishing are documented in
executor_runtime_current_shared_flow.puml
end note

DispatchStepUseCase -> CapabilityResolver: resolve(step.execute_by)
CapabilityResolver -> ToolRegistry: Lookup tool metadata via registry API
ToolRegistry --> CapabilityResolver: ResolvedCapability(LOCAL_TOOL) or None

alt Registry lookup failed
CapabilityResolver --> DispatchStepUseCase: None
DispatchStepUseCase --> DispatchStepResult: StepResult(error: capability not found)
else Capability disabled
CapabilityResolver --> DispatchStepUseCase: ResolvedCapability(enabled=false)
DispatchStepUseCase --> DispatchStepResult: StepResult(error: capability disabled)
else LOCAL_TOOL capability resolved
CapabilityResolver --> DispatchStepUseCase: ResolvedCapability(LOCAL_TOOL)
alt tool_name missing
DispatchStepUseCase --> DispatchStepResult: StepResult(error: missing tool_name)
note over DispatchStepUseCase #FEE2E2
ERROR:
Resolved LOCAL_TOOL capability has no usable tool_name.
end note
else Execute local tool
DispatchStepUseCase -> LocalToolExecutor: execute(tool_name, step)
opt Workflow tool calls control plane internally
LocalToolExecutor -> WorkflowControlPlane: submit/start_run/patch_data
WorkflowControlPlane --> LocalToolExecutor: Tool response
note over WorkflowControlPlane #FEF3C7
WARNING:
Optional behavior for workflow-backed local tools.
end note
end
alt Local tool execution succeeded
LocalToolExecutor --> DispatchStepUseCase: StepResult(success, output)
DispatchStepUseCase --> DispatchStepResult: StepResult(success)
note over LocalToolExecutor #DCFCE7
SUCCESS:
Local tool execution completed and produced a step result.
end note
else Local tool execution failed
LocalToolExecutor --> DispatchStepUseCase: StepResult(error)
DispatchStepUseCase --> DispatchStepResult: StepResult(error)
note over LocalToolExecutor #FEE2E2
ERROR:
Local tool execution failed and returned StepResult(error).
end note
end
end
end
end

legend right
  |= Color |= Meaning |
  |<#DCFCE7>| Success / implemented happy path |
  |<#FEF3C7>| TODO / warning / unclear |
  |<#FEE2E2>| Error / failure path |
  |<#EFF6FF>| Executor Runtime Service boundary |
  |<#F8FAFC>| External systems / queues / DB |
endlegend

@enduml
